  "body": "Same fix as romaine-life/my-homepage#84.\n\nDependabot auto-merges were performed with the default `GITHUB_TOKEN`, whose pushes never fire `push` workflows (GitHub recursive-trigger guard) — so merged bumps landed on main without triggering this repo's deploy/apply workflows. Now the auto-merge workflow mints an `infra-bootstrap-github-app` installation token (downscoped to contents+pull-requests write, key from org Dependabot secret `AUTOMERGE_APP_PRIVATE_KEY`) and merges with that, so the merge push triggers workflows normally.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
